{"id":"9b4f7dcf09c24689c2530ac820f779bdeb95bab2","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/003/902.htm","title":"谷歌最强 AI 模型：Gemini 4 Pro 开测，SVG 生图表现惊艳","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：故渊","excerpt":"根据 @LuminaBench 等网友反馈，谷歌正以“gemini-3.8-flash”名称，在 Arena 等基准平台测试 Gemini 4 Pro 模型，内部开发代号为 Argon。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            \r\n            <p data-vmark=\"6337\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 9 月 18 日消息，根据 @LuminaBench 等网友反馈，谷歌正以“gemini-3.8-flash”名称，<strong>在 Arena 等基准平台测试其最强 Gemini 4 Pro 模型，内部开发代号为 Argon。</strong></p><p data-vmark=\"f9d0\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5c19b161-50a6-4488-93fc-5f7d1aca8b34.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"748\" h=\"1058\" data-mpos=\"2,0\" data-snap-from=\"%7B%22from%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FLuminaBench%2Fstatus%2F2100495132361383987%22%2C%22qualityMode%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22link%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FLuminaBench%2Fstatus%2F2100495132361383987%22%2C%22qualityValue%22%3A%22original%22%7D\" data-vmark=\"a92c\" title=\"谷歌最强 AI 模型：Gemini 4 Pro 开测，SVG 生图表现惊艳\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5c19b161-50a6-4488-93fc-5f7d1aca8b34.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"748\" height=\"1058\"></p><p data-vmark=\"013e\">根据网友晒出的模型测试图片，在生成经典的“鹈鹕骑自行车”SVG 图片为例，其非常优秀，该网友还附上了和 OpenAI 最强模型 GPT-6 Astra Pro 的对比，并认为在谷歌官方发布后，Gemini 4 Pro 模型的能力会进一步提升。</p><p data-vmark=\"aac3\">IT之家附上相关截图如下：</p><p data-vmark=\"61e7\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/e2077462-0448-4502-9652-bbbac9c1b234.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"748\" h=\"933\" data-mpos=\"2,0\" data-snap-from=\"%7B%22from%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FLuminaBench%2Fstatus%2F2100580930549121214%22%2C%22qualityMode%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22link%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FLuminaBench%2Fstatus%2F2100580930549121214%22%2C%22qualityValue%22%3A%22original%22%7D\" data-vmark=\"792a\" title=\"谷歌最强 AI 模型：Gemini 4 Pro 开测，SVG 生图表现惊艳\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/e2077462-0448-4502-9652-bbbac9c1b234.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"748\" height=\"933\"></p><p data-vmark=\"ff3e\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/4a83eb34-6546-4e95-b346-b58f9f122040.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"748\" h=\"1265\" data-mpos=\"2,0\" data-snap-from=\"%7B%22from%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FLuminaBench%2Fstatus%2F2100590415141327080%22%2C%22qualityMode%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22link%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FLuminaBench%2Fstatus%2F2100590415141327080%22%2C%22qualityValue%22%3A%22original%22%7D\" data-vmark=\"25d7\" title=\"谷歌最强 AI 模型：Gemini 4 Pro 开测，SVG 生图表现惊艳\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/4a83eb34-6546-4e95-b346-b58f9f122040.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"748\" height=\"1265\"></p>\r\n        </div></DIV>","content_text":"IT之家 9 月 18 日消息，根据 @LuminaBench 等网友反馈，谷歌正以“gemini-3.8-flash”名称，在 Arena 等基准平台测试其最强 Gemini 4 Pro 模型，内部开发代号为 Argon。根据网友晒出的模型测试图片，在生成经典的“鹈鹕骑自行车”SVG 图片为例，其非常优秀，该网友还附上了和 OpenAI 最强模型 GPT-6 Astra Pro 的对比，并认为在谷歌官方发布后，Gemini 4 Pro 模型的能力会进一步提升。IT之家附上相关截图如下：","fetched_at":"2026-09-18T20:14:53.118Z","ok":true}